# Raw run evidence stays local: the Claude event streams, stderr, full tool
# transcripts, failed attempts, the progress file and each scenario's copy of
# the files it wrote. The results, grading, replies, per-scenario meta and the
# harness are tracked. The deliverables themselves are collected into the
# system's export/benchmark/ by run/collect_exports.py.
*.jsonl
*.stderr.txt
transcript-turn-*.md
failed-attempts/
exports/
run-progress.txt
